# Every dependency is pinned to an exact version, so a fresh install and a
# six-month-old lockfile resolve to the same tree. Without this, `pnpm add`
# writes a caret and the next person to install gets a version nobody chose --
# which for a native binary like rolldown or oxc-parser is a different binary.
#
# `packages/cli/test/cli.test.ts` asserts it, because a setting only the person
# who ran `pnpm add` sees is a setting that drifts.
save-exact=true
